error[E0107]: [CGP-E037] `AreaCalculator` is a provider trait and cannot be a `#[uses]` dependency; a dependency names its consumer trait `CanCalculateArea`
  --> src/main.rs:27:8
   |
27 | #[uses(AreaCalculator)]
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name the consumer trait instead: `#[uses(CanCalculateArea)]` (not the provider trait `AreaCalculator`)

